_kitty_207/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3924920, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f249a987b118f1892beebcc0f9f4c144", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f249a987b118f1892beebcc0f9f4c144, https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de656921e448775bf459899b058b9708 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=283d8bc063dbdd8c03e8e8abdeb242d2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8b0523a7708e526e170c9ef4ed31aad", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8b0523a7708e526e170c9ef4ed31aad, https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=adcacb147d36576ba06543865a89bd73 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ce313611273fbc6b3314640e0fe24235 3x"}, "body": "Hello, AN-sensei.\nI’ve been following your wonderful illustrations on X for a while now. I really love your Poolverine illustrations.\nIf you’re willing to take on this commission, I’d be truly grateful.\n\n······\n★ Please draw a scene where [Character 1] hugs [Character 2] from behind and kisses them. The two are in an intimate, romantic relationship.\n[Character 1] is wearing a white T-shirt, and [Character 2] is wearing a black T-shirt.\n★The NSFW setting is intended to expand creative possibilities; it does not necessarily require erotic content.\n······\n\nCharacter 1 (Maverick) reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R9kuaX5LO0_XfCyg7O_AprgIYfnf0chM\n\nCharacter 2 (Thermite) reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SAKQ1ZBzru35FHLfy2aETQpyLLTRALqr\n\n\n1. Neither character is wearing hats, glasses, goggles, scarves, etc.\nSimilarly, there is no need to draw complex tactical gear.\n\n\n◆2. [Character 2]’s hand is bandaged.\nCharacter 2 has a burn on their arm, so please be careful when drawing that area.\n\nIf Character 1’s left arm is exposed, please include a tattoo on the left arm that resembles the shape of a map of Afghanistan.\nFor the specific tattoo design, please refer to [4-Left Arm Tattoo] in the “Reference Materials.”\n\n\n3. Character 1: Blonde hair. Blue eyes. Has a beard.\nCharacter 2: Black hair. Blue eyes. Has a beard.\nBoth characters are middle-aged, around 35 years old.\nNote that Character 1 is slightly taller.\n\n\n\n4. If you would like to know more about the characters’ personalities:\nCharacter 1: Intellectual and wise, a good listener who keeps his emotions to himself while pursuing freedom.\nCharacter 2: Kind, loyal, and patient.\nThe two are comrades-in-arms.\n\n\nIntended Use: Personal viewing, computer desktop wallpaper, and other personal uses\n\n\n\nI apologize for the complexity of my request. Please bear with me.\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R9kuaX5LO0_XfCyg7O_AprgIYfnf0chM", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_sam