 man OC, Wulf!\n\nWulf | 56 | 170cm\nHe lives in a world with supernatural beings called \"Sin\". He used to be a mercenary, and he met his husband, who was also a mercenary. They retired and married each other. Wulf became a bartender. His husband died from alcohol poisoning, which made Wulf very guilty. He was in so much pain that he manifested supernatural powers. He can create a palace in his mind, which looks like a bar. He also started to hallucinate his dead husband. \n\nMotif: alcohol, warm light, mahogany, sniper rifle, explosion\n\nYou can draw him in a serious setting or a sexy setting, I love both!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/37344168.wulf/gallery", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@worst_kitty_207/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3924920, "client_id": 3932189, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bef54591/uploads/origins/6ca31c5b-05bc-42b6-8a89-8ccd0532817e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e302280e0a080f72af316b769d7dbb95", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bef54591/uploads/origins/6ca31c5b-05bc-42b6-8a89-8ccd0532817e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e302280e0a080f72af316b769d7dbb95, https://si.imgix.net/bef54591/uploads/origins/6ca31c5b-05bc-42b6-8a89-8ccd0532817e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f6d108d1282b9eee109d93b11327889 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bef54591/uploads/origins/6ca31c5b-05bc-42b6-8a89-8ccd0532817e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a48ea3df55ce8dc192730b13be4bdf4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bef54591/uploads/origins/6ca31c5b-05bc-42b6-8a89-8ccd0532817e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=t